# Anda C Smoke Hub POS — environment
#
# This build is OFFLINE-FIRST and needs no environment file to run. Copy this to
# `.env` only if you want to override a default.
#
# Never commit a real .env, API key or database credential.

# ── Where the till keeps its data ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Folder that holds anda-smoke-hub.sqlite (products, sales, staff accounts).
# In the desktop app this is set automatically to Electron's userData folder.
# Leave unset to use ./.data during development.
# ANDA_DATA_DIR=C:\Users\YourName\AppData\Roaming\anda-smoke-hub-pos

# ── Port for the standalone API server ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Only used by `npm run dev:api` for browser development. The desktop app picks a
# free port automatically.
# ANDA_API_PORT=4310

# ── Session signing key ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. Staff sign-in tokens are signed with a key generated automatically and
# stored in the database, so PINs keep working across restarts.
# Set this only if you want to manage the key yourself (min 32 characters).
# JWT_SECRET=

# ── Development only ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Uses a fixed, publicly known signing key so tests and local runs are
# reproducible. NEVER set this on a real till.
# ANDA_INSECURE_DEV_SECRET=1